    ./grade                       run every test
    ./grade pa_lazy ckpt_incr     run some tests

Builds xv6 on one CPU, runs vmcheck, and compares its "ev" lines with the
expected ones. Points: q0, q1, q2 10 each (pa_*, dirty_*, prot_*), q3 70
